    "今天第 %lld 次提醒 · 你答应过自己的" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Reminder #%lld today · you promised yourself" } } } },
    "心理能量" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "MIND ENERGY" } } } },
    "生理能量" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "BODY ENERGY" } } } },
    "久坐掉的。站起来 3 分钟就能回 10 点" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "That's from sitting. Three minutes on your feet gets 10 back" } } } },
    "心理有点耗。跟我说说，或者出去走走？" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mind's a bit worn. Tell me about it, or take a walk?" } } } },
    "状态不错。保持这个节奏就好" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Looking good. Keep this pace" } } } },
    "这就去" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "On it" } } } },
    "3 分钟后" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "In 3 min" } } } },
    "随便说点什么" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Say anything" } } } },
    "一直都在" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "always here" } } } },
    "懒猫" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "dozycat" } } } },
    "好烦，方案又被打回来了" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ugh, the proposal got sent back again" } } } },
    "第三稿了对吧，换谁都会烦的。先不想它——你从中午到现在还没喝过水，去接一杯，回来要是还想说，我在。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Third draft, right? Anyone would be fed up. Forget it for now — you haven't had water since noon. Grab a cup; if you still want to talk after, I'm here." } } } },
    "它记下了：这个项目最近让你很耗" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Noted: this project has been draining you lately" } } } },
    "（模型连不上了…没关系，我自己也能陪你。）" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "(Couldn't reach the model… that's okay, I can keep you company myself.)" } } } },
    "嗯嗯，我听着呢。不用急，慢慢说。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mm-hm, I'm listening. No rush, take your time." } } } },
    "找点什么，或者直接问" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Find something, or just ask" } } } },
    "回忆" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "MEMORIES" } } } },
    "文件" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "FILES" } } } },
    "没找到。直接问问它？" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Nothing found. Just ask it?" } } } },
    "想一下……" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Thinking…" } } } },
    "它想起来的依据" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "WHAT IT REMEMBERED FROM" } } } },
    "↵ 打开" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "↵ open" } } } },
    "esc 关闭" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "esc close" } } } },
    "回忆搜索在本机完成，不上传" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Memory search happens on this Mac — nothing uploaded" } } } },
    "（要先在设置里配一个模型，我才能翻着回忆回答你。）" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "(Set up a model in Settings first, then I can answer from your memories.)" } } } },
    "（模型连不上了…先翻给你看我记得的，在下面。）" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "(Couldn't reach the model… here's what I remember, below.)" } } } },
    "「有点怕见小林」——后来你们和好了" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“A bit nervous to see Lin” — you two made up after" } } } },
    "和小林见面聊开了，回来路上有点空落落的" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Met Lin and talked it out; felt a little empty on the way back" } } } },
    "「右边智齿疼得没睡好」" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“Right wisdom tooth ached — barely slept”" } } } },
    "「医生建议拔，我说缓缓再说」" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“Dentist said pull it; I said let it wait”" } } } },
    "妈妈想吃你做的番茄牛腩，你说周末回家做" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mom wants your tomato beef stew; you said you'd cook it this weekend" } } } },
